\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crystal\" title=\"Crystal\">Crystal</a>:</b> <a href=\"/page/Crystal\" title=\"Crystal\">Crystal</a> weapons are able to overcome the protective <a href=\"/page/Damage_reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage reduction\">damage reduction</a> of many <a href=\"/page/Quori\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quori\">Quori</a> creatures, which can be resistant to other weapons. <br /> Spell failure chances for armors and shields made from crystal are also decreased by 10%.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0012800002</span>12,800<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;2<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">cp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Copper Piece</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">4 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Reaver%27s_Fate\" title=\"The Reaver&#39;s Fate\">The Reaver's Fate</a></b>, Raid Warded chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Greater&#32;Evil Outsider Bane</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Greater&#32;Evil Outsider Bane</a>:</b> A bane weapon excels at attacking one type or subtype of creature. Against Evil Outsiders, this weapon's effective enhancement bonus is +4 better than its normal enhancement bonus. It deals an extra 3 to 18 points of damage against the foe.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Life_Stealing\" title=\"Life Stealing\">Life Stealing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Life_Stealing\" title=\"Life Stealing\">Life Stealing</a>:</b> This weapon has a chance to drain 1 to 3 levels from its target on a critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Enchantment Focus II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Enchantment Focus II</a>:</b> +2 Equipment bonus to the DC of Enchantment spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a>: This psionic item is powerful, but you sense that it has not unlocked all of its secrets to you at this time.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Holy\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Holy</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Holy\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Holy</a>:</b> A holy weapon is imbued with holy power. This power makes the weapon good-aligned. Evil characters wielding this weapon suffer a negative level. The weapon deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all targets of <a href=\"/page/Evil\" title=\"Evil\">evil</a> alignment.</span></span></li>\n<li>Becomes <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Stormreaver)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)\">Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Stormreaver)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)\">Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)</a>: This item could be upgraded if you found a <a href=\"/page/Item:Seal_of_the_Stormreaver\" title=\"Item:Seal of the Stormreaver\">Seal of the Stormreaver</a> to combine it with. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Stormreaver_Monument\" title=\"Stormreaver Monument\">Stormreaver Monument</a> in <a href=\"/page/Gianthold\" title=\"Gianthold\">Gianthold</a> and combine it with a Seal of the Stormreaver to upgrade the item to a more powerful form.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Force_Burst#Force_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Burst\">Force Burst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Force_Burst#Force_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Burst\">Force Burst</a>:</b> This weapon is humming with magical force, and does 1 to 6 force damage each hit. Critical hits deal an additional 1 to 10 force damage for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 2 to 20 for a x3 multiplier and 3 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Dreamspitter.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Dreamspitter.png/420px-Dreamspitter.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"613\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Dreamspitter.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Stormreaver_Monument\" title=\"Stormreaver Monument\">Stormreaver Monument</a>&#160;or <a href=\"/page/Dreamforge\" title=\"Dreamforge\">Dreamforge</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This is a truly ancient relic of the giant wars against Dal Quor. The dream-monsters were best fought with weapons that struck down the spirit, rather than the flesh.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>Pre U12 versions missing Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver) can have this added via the Stormreaver Monument with 5 Ancient Elven Relics. Existing upgrades (Holy, Force Damage Ritual, etc.) are maintained.</li>\n<li>Some old versions of the Dreamspitter do not have the Suppressed Power. This cannot be added, but you can add Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver) and then Force Burst.</li>\n<li>The negative levels inflicted by a critical hit from Dreamspitter reduce the victim's saving throws, and that effect stacks with itself.</li>\n<li>Dreamspitter becomes Bound to Character once the suppressed power is unlocked, but remains Bound to Account when the Stormreaver Seal upgrade is applied.</li></ul>\n<p>With the application of the <a href=\"/page/Seal_of_the_Stormreaver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Seal of the Stormreaver\">Seal of the Stormreaver</a> and a <a href=\"/page/Crystal_Disk_of_Dreams\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crystal Disk of Dreams\">Crystal Disk of Dreams</a>, this weapon can be upgraded to:\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Dreamspitter_(upgraded).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Upgraded &amp; Unsuppressed Version\"><img alt=\"Upgraded &amp; Unsuppressed Version\" src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Dreamspitter_%28upgraded%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"472\" height=\"720\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption>Upgraded &amp; Unsuppressed Version</figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816203310\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.107 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.188 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5610/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49105/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15808/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 9/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  162.613      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  162.613      1 -total\n 96.40%  156.752      1 Template:Name